{"id":"input-f2106387abf9","steamAppId":"1011390","name":"Field of Glory: Empires","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011390/","genres":["Strategy"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":true,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":2.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"2 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-f2106387abf9","canonicalId":"steam-app-1011390","suppliedName":"Field of Glory: Empires","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Field of Glory: Empires","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2019,"developers":["Ageod"],"publishers":["Slitherine Ltd."],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Strategy"],"shortDescription":"Field of Glory: Empires is a grand strategy game in which you will have to move in an intricate and living tapestry of nations and tribes, each one with their distinctive culture.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"1011390"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011390/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:50.396Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:50.396Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1011390","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011390/","officialWebsite":"http://www.slitherine.com/products/product.asp?gid=789","support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"},"recommended":null},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"unknown","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":true,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player","Multi-player"]},"genres":["Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1011390","steamName":"Field of Glory: Empires","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1011390/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:40:25.732478+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Field of Glory: Empires is a grand strategy game in which you will have to move in an intricate and living tapestry of nations and tribes, each one with their distinctive culture.","detailedDescription":"MASTERS EDITION BUNDLE\n\nFor you willing to have direct control over specific battles, if you own Field of Glory 2, you can import tactical battles from Empires into FOG2 and vice versa. We have set up a Field of Glory Masters Edition. This edition is a bundle including FOG2 and FOG Empires 25% discounted.\n\nAbout the Game\nCivilizations come and go; common men and kings they get covered by the dust of time in the same way. Monuments and wonders crumble under their own weight. But the cultural legacy is not bygone. Stories and tales about ancestors and their deeds pass through generations, the old knowledge is not lost forever. Soon, new societies, new kingdoms, new civilizations rise from the seeds of the ones which predated them. Decadence is not the end.\n\nWill your legacy stand the test of time?\n\nField of Glory: Empires is a grand strategy game in which you will have to move in an intricate and living tapestry of nations and tribes, each one with their distinctive culture.\n\nSet in Europe and in the Mediterranean Area during the Classical Age, experience what truly means to manage an Empire.\n\nExpand your dominion through wars of conquest and make your culture a beacon of light, but be careful though. The risk of Decadence is not trivial. Many civilizations have collapsed for not having seen in time the signs of impending crisis. The older your empire, the more challenges will lurk in the shadows. Just expanding your borders without carefully shaping your form of government and culture won’t be the wisest of strategies.\n\nManage your Empire on a scale that fits you: adjust all the details of an important region, form provinces to oversee your growing realm.\n\nConstruct buildings to enhance your army, the life of your citizens, and the economy. Establish and grow a trade network of goods and resources.\n\nThe battle system is not just about who brings the larger force. Army composition and understanding the strengths and weaknesses of you and your enemy are decisive, so is choosing wisely the battlefield and the general to lead your troops.\n\nAnd, if you want even more direct control, Field of Glory: Empires lets you export and load your battles into Field of Glory II and then load the results back into Field of Glory: Empires!\n\nWar is decided not just by battles though, but also clever manoeuvres. Simultaneous (WEGO) turn resolution means thinking ahead to intercept – or to escape! – enemy armies will be essential. Field of Glory: Empires offers a living world where every decision has an impact on every actor.\n\nAnd once you think you are ready to be challenged, play against real opponents in one of the largest asynchronous multiplayer system ever created.","aboutGame":"Civilizations come and go; common men and kings they get covered by the dust of time in the same way. Monuments and wonders crumble under their own weight. But the cultural legacy is not bygone. Stories and tales about ancestors and their deeds pass through generations, the old knowledge is not lost forever. Soon, new societies, new kingdoms, new civilizations rise from the seeds of the ones which predated them. Decadence is not the end.\n\nWill your legacy stand the test of time?\n\nField of Glory: Empires is a grand strategy game in which you will have to move in an intricate and living tapestry of nations and tribes, each one with their distinctive culture.\n\nSet in Europe and in the Mediterranean Area during the Classical Age, experience what truly means to manage an Empire.\n\nExpand your dominion through wars of conquest and make your culture a beacon of light, but be careful though. The risk of Decadence is not trivial. Many civilizations have collapsed for not having seen in time the signs of impending crisis. The older your empire, the more challenges will lurk in the shadows. Just expanding your borders without carefully shaping your form of government and culture won’t be the wisest of strategies.\n\nManage your Empire on a scale that fits you: adjust all the details of an important region, form provinces to oversee your growing realm.\n\nConstruct buildings to enhance your army, the life of your citizens, and the economy. Establish and grow a trade network of goods and resources.\n\nThe battle system is not just about who brings the larger force. Army composition and understanding the strengths and weaknesses of you and your enemy are decisive, so is choosing wisely the battlefield and the general to lead your troops.\n\nAnd, if you want even more direct control, Field of Glory: Empires lets you export and load your battles into Field of Glory II and then load the results back into Field of Glory: Empires!\n\nWar is decided not just by battles though, but also clever manoeuvres. Simultaneous (WEGO) turn resolution means thinking ahead to intercept – or to escape! – enemy armies will be essential. Field of Glory: Empires offers a living world where every decision has an impact on every actor.\n\nAnd once you think you are ready to be challenged, play against real opponents in one of the largest asynchronous multiplayer system ever created."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/header.jpg?t=1728379224"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728379224"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/extras/3a2d2a63a2829a2aa6932a225b0707a9.avif?t=1728379224","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/extras/efa2c83feed9070bd33da4bca5e6fcaa.avif?t=1728379224","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/extras/64ca541b745ac07aa71d975b58509ec0.avif?t=1728379224","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1011390/e